  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are so adept at aligning ki that you can align without having to balance it first.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wis 13, 10th-level sadhu.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can realign ki directly from yin to yang or yang to yin without having to realign ki into a state of balance first. In addition, you can realign two chakras simultaneously.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc105\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
